// BT-3556 (ADR 0124 Section 8/B9) regression fixture: a `typed` Actor with a
// `late` slot (no default, absent from a migration's chained dictionary
// stays absent rather than failing reconcile the way an ordinary
// typed-no-default field would) alongside an ordinary eager field with a
// default, so beamtalk_shape_migration_tests can exercise both branches of
// reconcile_declared/7 against one class: `label` (eager, has a default,
// used when absent) and `proc` (late, no default, stays absent when absent).

typed Actor subclass: TypedLateSlotActor
  late state: proc :: String
  state: label :: String = "unset"

  getLabel -> String => self.label
